      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "(oral)\n1. An application under Section 378 (iii) Cr.P.C has been filed on behalf of the State for seeking Leave to Appeal against the Order dated 15.09.2020 vide which the learned Addl. Sessions Judge-06, Special Court, POCSO, North, Rohini, while convicting the respondent/ accused Dinesh @ Bala under Section 8 of POCSO Act and respondent/ accused Imran under Section 8 read with section 17 of POCSO Act, acquitted respondent Dinesh @ Bala under Section 328/376D IPC and Section 6 of POCSO Act and respondent/ accused Imran under Section 323/376 (D) IPC and Section 6 of POCSO Act.",
