    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "2. The case of the prosecution is that a complaint was made by child victim 'N' stating that on 11.03.2018 at about 11 A.M while was going to her tailor, the accused Imran who was known to her,\nmet her and informed that her sister was being beaten up by her husband and that the victim should talk to her sister on telephone.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1163,
      "end": 1489,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "11.03.2018",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1260,
          "end": 1270
        },
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1330,
          "end": 1335
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2504918873310089
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "While talking, Imran pushed her inside the room belonging to the uncle of co-accused Dinesh @ Bala, who was already present inside the room.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1490,
      "end": 1630,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1505,
          "end": 1510
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinesh @ Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1575,
          "end": 1588
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2576596736907959
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Imran bolted the door from outside and left.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1631,
      "end": 1675,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1631,
          "end": 1636
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24694398045539856
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Accused Bala gagged her mouth.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1676,
      "end": 1706,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1684,
          "end": 1688
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25698503851890564
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The other accused Imran returned to the room with a cold drink which he gave to the accused Bala and left.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1707,
      "end": 1813,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1725,
          "end": 1730
        },
        {
          "text": "Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1799,
          "end": 1803
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2517898976802826
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The victim was forced to consume cold drink by accused Bala after which she lost her senses.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1814,
      "end": 1906,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1869,
          "end": 1873
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29477638006210327
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "When she regained her consciousness,\nshe found herself naked and had some pain in her genitals.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1907,
      "end": 2002,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2745201885700226
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "When she questioned accused Bala as to what had happened, he informed her that he has done the same thing as a husband does to a wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2003,
      "end": 2137,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 2031,
          "end": 2035
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26624783873558044
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "He also threatened her not to disclose the incident to anyone or else he would kill her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2138,
      "end": 2227,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2781451642513275
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "On her complaint, FIR under Section 323/376/328/506 IPC and 4 POCSO Act was registered.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2228,
      "end": 2315,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 323/376/328/506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2256,
          "end": 2279
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2280,
          "end": 2283
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2290,
          "end": 2299
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5288369655609131
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The investigations were done and the Charge Sheet was accordingly filed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2316,
      "end": 2388,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2749553918838501
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "State Of Nct Of Delhi vs Dinesh @ Bala & Anr.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2390,
      "end": 2435,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "State Of Nct Of Delhi vs Dinesh @ Bala & Anr",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2390,
          "end": 2434
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4423920512199402
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "on 19 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/115492415/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2436,
      "end": 2514,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "19 September, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2439,
          "end": 2457
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2458,
          "end": 2471
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21916379034519196
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3. Charges under Section 328/376D of IPC and Section 6 POCSO Act, 2012 were framed against the accused Dinesh @ Bala and accused Imran.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2515,
      "end": 2650,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 328/376D",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2532,
          "end": 2548
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2552,
          "end": 2555
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 6",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2560,
          "end": 2569
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act, 2012",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2570,
          "end": 2585
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinesh @ Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 2618,
          "end": 2631
        },
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 2644,
          "end": 2649
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3622864782810211
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "4. The prosecution in support of its case examined 13 witnesses the most significant witness being victim 'N' who was examined as PW1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2651,
      "end": 2786,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "N",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2759,
          "end": 2760
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18441061675548553
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "5. The statement of the accused were recorded under Section 313 Cr.P.C where they pleaded their innocence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2787,
      "end": 2894,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 313",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2840,
          "end": 2851
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2852,
          "end": 2858
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20855723321437836
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "6. The respondent/ accused also examined two witnesses in support of their defence, who deposed that it was on account of some dispute between them that they had been falsely implicated in this case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2895,
      "end": 3095,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16689173877239227
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Moreover, the accused and the victim arrived at a settlement Ex.DW1/A which had the thumb impression of the mother and sister of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3096,
      "end": 3236,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19597384333610535
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "7. Learned ASJ in the impugned judgment held that the age of the victim was 14 years 7 months and 1 day on the date of incident as her date of birth was 10.08.2003 as per the School record as Ex.PW4/A to Ex.PW4/D.\n8.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3238,
      "end": 3454,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "10.08.2003",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3391,
          "end": 3401
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09442363679409027
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The learned ASJ further considered the testimony of the prosecutrix to conclude that as per her own testimony, she had become unconscious after taking the drink and was not aware of what transpired.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3455,
      "end": 3653,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13934850692749023
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The other piece of evidence was the Medical Report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3654,
      "end": 3705,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1511319875717163
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "However, in the MLC though it was found that her hymen was torn but it did not reflect any fresh injury.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3706,
      "end": 3810,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17383916676044464
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "It was held by learned ASJ that the testimony of the prosecutrix was consistent and the contradictions on which reliance had been placed by the accused, were inconsequential.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3811,
      "end": 3985,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18283571302890778
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "It was concluded that there was no conclusive evidence either of the prosecutrix or by way of MLC or FSL to prove that there had been penetrative assault committed upon her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 3986,
      "end": 4159,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20385858416557312
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "Considering her testimony and the MLC Report it was held that the offence under Section 6 POCSO Act and Section 376D was not made out against the accused Dinesh @ Bala and he was convicted under Section 8 of the POCSO Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 4160,
      "end": 4382,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4240,
          "end": 4249
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4250,
          "end": 4259
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 376D",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4264,
          "end": 4276
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinesh @ Bala",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 4314,
          "end": 4327
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 8",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4355,
          "end": 4364
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4372,
          "end": 4381
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2746845483779907
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Accused Imran was held guilty for the abatement to the said crime and was convicted under Section 8 read with Section 17 of the POCSO Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 4383,
      "end": 4521,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Imran",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 4391,
          "end": 4396
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 8 read with Section 17",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4473,
          "end": 4503
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4511,
          "end": 4520
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3666447401046753
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "9. The State being aggrieved of the acquittal of the two accused under Section 6 POCSO Act and Section 376D/328 IPC, has preferred the present application seeking Leave to Appeal against the impugned judgment.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 4523,
      "end": 4732,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4594,
          "end": 4603
        },
        {
